# Picture and Orbit

Full rules: `STUDIO_PLAYBOOK.md` §5–§6.

- **Tools:** Vertex AI on the account's free credit (Omni from location `global`; never AI Studio prepaid). **Veo** for world plates (Fast; one Quality hero only if it earns the thumbnail). **Omni only when Orbit moves.** Stills first, then 2–3 Veo Fast money shots. No Kling, Seedance or ElevenLabs Image & Video. Never a whole planet as an Omni/Veo start frame.
- **Picture matches the sentence,** one world per film. Mute test: the beat still reads with the VO off.
- **Teach on screen (Ben, 11 Oct 2026):** DATA charts, WHO cards, WHEN call-outs and FACT cards are our own code graphics or edit overlays, one render per row, never sourced charts or diagrams (those FAIL `picture_qa.py`). Each animates in (charts build with the spoken number); none holds still for more than 4 s; never two code graphics back to back; no black slabs; house type, labels of 4 words or fewer. Chief scores DATA, WHO, WHEN, FACT, STYLE and MOTION PASS/FAIL. AGENTS.md → *Teach on screen*.
- **Polish pass (Astrum ref, 11 Oct 2026):** physics/mechanism sections use our explainer look (glowing lines on a lifted dark-navy grid, real bodies, passes near-black, footage between diagrams). Fine grain on dark space (never rescues a near-black frame), DOF blur off the subject, 0.5–1.5 s crossfades within the 4 s hold, small bottom-left credits (CGI, NASA, Artist's impression). Chief scores SFX, MUSIC, GRAIN, SCALE, EXPLAINER, FINISH. AGENTS.md → *Polish pass*.
- **Silent picture:** strip Veo/Omni audio. No text or logos in generated plates.
- **Never:** reuse a cutscene, loop scenery to pad, slow-mo, freeze-pad, or Ken-Burns text cards.
- **Space and water:** near-black space; honest environments; no Earth globe over an ocean/shore POV; one Earth + one Moon at most.
- **Orbit:**
  - canonical still `01_Orbit-Character/05_Seedance-References/orbit-seedance-reference-16x9-v01.png`, never `_Rejected/`;
  - matte orange, no legs, one black visor face with two cream eyes with pupils, three-finger hands, one antenna, exactly one underside glow.
  - **Reject:** twins, a second face, blank eyes, legs, belly glow, text on the body, side thrusters, a melted or void face.
  - Spot-check the start, middle and end of every Omni take.
- **Dosage:** longs 1–2 acting beats; Shorts from about 1 s, never frame 0; thumbnails never.
